{"source": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/commits?path=docs/13-decisions/0004-mcp-capability-model.md&sha=68c8ea65f918d7c07bfc72ffcc2f0e910bb7c8c0&per_page=100", "body": [{"sha": "68c8ea65f918d7c07bfc72ffcc2f0e910bb7c8c0", "node_id": "C_kwDORlNmBNoAKDY4YzhlYTY1ZjkxOGQ3YzA3YmZjNzJmZmNjMmYwZTkxMGJiN2M4YzA", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Andrej Koelewijn", "email": "andrej@koelewijn.net", "date": "2026-06-15T19:38:09Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Andrej Koelewijn", "email": "andrej@koelewijn.net", "date": "2026-06-15T19:38:09Z"}, "message": "docs(adr): renumber MCP ADRs 0004/0005 \u2192 0006/0007 (resolve collision)\n\nThe main merge brought two Proposed MCP ADRs numbered 0004/0005, colliding with\nthe Accepted engine ADRs of the same numbers (0004 full-codec-engine, 0005\nsemantic-model-interface-currency). The Accepted engine ADRs keep their numbers;\nrenumber the MCP ADRs to 0006/0007 and update all cross-references (titles, the\nADR index, PED_MCP_CAPABILITIES.md, PROPOSAL_mcp_backend.md).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>", "tree": {"sha": "83bc3be1bc7beb6986de28ea4bc00453e64c63f5", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/git/trees/83bc3be1bc7beb6986de28ea4bc00453e64c63f5"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/git/commits/68c8ea65f918d7c07bfc72ffcc2f0e910bb7c8c0", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/commits/68c8ea65f918d7c07bfc72ffcc2f0e910bb7c8c0", "html_url": "https://github.com/mendixlabs/mxcli/commit/68c8ea65f918d7c07bfc72ffcc2f0e910bb7c8c0", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/commits/68c8ea65f918d7c07bfc72ffcc2f0e910bb7c8c0/comments", "author": {"login": "ako", "id": 144523, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDUyMw==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144523?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako", "html_url": "https://github.com/ako", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "ako", "id": 144523, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDUyMw==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144523?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako", "html_url": "https://github.com/ako", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ako/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "53b0a902f5daf31ef3316bf134306e3a974d03db", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/commits/53b0a902f5daf31ef3316bf134306e3a974d03db", "html_url": "https://github.com/mendixlabs/mxcli/commit/53b0a902f5daf31ef3316bf134306e3a974d03db"}]}, {"sha": "006e87403238c8fb2d0c59228d1bc59ae09b734a", "node_id": "C_kwDORlNmBNoAKDAwNmU4NzQwMzIzOGM4ZmIyZDBjNTkyMjhkMWJjNTlhZTA5YjczNGE", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Andrej Koelewijn", "email": "andrej@koelewijn.net", "date": "2026-06-11T07:33:27Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Andrej Koelewijn", "email": "andrej@koelewijn.net", "date": "2026-06-11T09:44:46Z"}, "message": "docs(adr): ADR-0004 version-aware MCP capability model + proposal build plan\n\nAs PED's authoring surface grows per Studio Pro version, two needs emerge: the\nbackend must adapt behavior across versions, and an agent must know what's\nauthorable against the connected version before generating MDL (the same shape as\nthe existing Mendix-version axis: show features + the version-awareness skill).\n\nADR-0004 decides the design: model PED authoring capability as one source of truth\ncomputed on connect \u2014 a live tools/list probe (for tool presence) merged with a\nversion-keyed table (for the create-whitelist and quirks that aren't\nschema-discoverable; we only learn them by trying). The backend gates on it; the\nagent report is generated from it, so they can't drift. PED_MCP_CAPABILITIES.md\nbecomes the human narrative over the machine table.\n\nRecords the build plan in PROPOSAL_mcp_backend.md (report \u2192 registry \u2192 gate, in\ndependency order) and points PED_MCP_CAPABILITIES.md at the ADR. Design only; no\ncode yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>", "tree": {"sha": "9203db1bb9296cfe85b3fad1a97d636a919adfd0", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/git/trees/9203db1bb9296cfe85b3fad1a97d636a919adfd0"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/git/commits/006e87403238c8fb2d0c59228d1bc59ae09b734a", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mendixlabs/mxcli/commits/006e87403238c8fb2d0c59228d1bc59ae09b734a", "html_url": "https://github.com/mendixlabs/mxcl